stream_errors.model_retry_prompt:
The model API request failed. Do not pretend the task succeeded.

What happened: {guidance}

Explain this to the user in their language and suggest the next step. Do not retry the same failing request unchanged.

Technical detail: {detail}

teams.followup_done:
[system wake-up, not a new user question]
Team member {name} finished. Their answer is already on the group timeline; it is not in your own chat context, so a truncated excerpt is included below for wrap-up.
Task: {task}

Member answer:
{result}

Use that answer to decide next steps. Do not paste it back in full. Do not say you have assigned someone or ask the user to wait. Do not call ask_agent for the same task again. If more work is needed, dispatch the next member. If the team is done, write at most three short wrap-up sentences and say whether you adopt their advice.

teams.followup_failed:
[system wake-up, not a new user question]
Team member {name} failed.
Task: {task}
Error: {error}

Briefly tell the user it failed and either dispatch someone else or close the turn. Do not announce another assignment. Do not invent a substitute answer.

